sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant T as Transfer Service
    participant O as OTP Service
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant B as External Bank Adapter
    C->>T: Yêu cầu chuyển liên ngân hàng
    T->>D: Validate và tạo OTP_REQUIRED
    T->>O: Gửi OTP
    C->>T: OTP
    T->>O: Verify/consume
    T->>D: Lock source, recheck, PROCESSING
    T->>B: Gửi lệnh + idempotency key
    B-->>T: Accepted / rejected
    T->>D: Debit + ledger + SUCCESS hoặc FAILED
    T-->>C: Kết quả
